    "updated_at": "2016-05-02T08:10:09Z",
    "body": "And on http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4126 Firefox and Chrome also agree: both reuse the Window of the initial `about:blank`.\n\nThey also agree on http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4124 in that neither one reuses the initial `about:blank` Window there.  I know why that happens in Firefox and I _think_ we consider it a bug, but I'd have to step through the spec carefully to see what's specced for this case right now.\n",
